---

This software is not a medical device. It reads and displays data recorded by a
CPAP/APAP machine using a file format determined by reverse engineering, not by
any manufacturer specification. It must not be used for diagnosis or for making
treatment decisions.

The `.BYS` binary format documentation this implementation is based on comes from
https://github.com/Centurix/djmed by Chris Read. No code from that project is
included here; the parser was written independently from the published format
tables.
